    },
    "The distribution service returned an invalid response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分发服务返回了无效响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The distribution service returned HTTP %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分发服务返回 HTTP %lld。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The distribution signing public key is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分发签名公钥无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download is size-limited and validated, then kept only for this preview session. It cannot enable system routing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容会经过大小限制和安全验证，并且仅在本次预览会话中保留；它不能启用系统路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded update failed its integrity check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的更新未通过完整性校验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded update is not a valid file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的更新不是有效文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded update is too large (%lld bytes).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的更新过大（%lld 字节）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The encryption key for saved profiles is unavailable. Export a report from Settings > Diagnostics for troubleshooting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存配置的加密密钥不可用。请在“设置 > 诊断”中导出诊断报告以排查问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The executable profile key ‘%@’ is not allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不允许使用可执行配置键“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The license does not match this product or Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该授权与此产品或这台 Mac 不匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The license has expired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "授权已过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local licensing identity is invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机授权标识无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The loopback proxy is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回环代理已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The loopback proxy will start with the next TUN connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回环代理将在下一次 TUN 连接时启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension could not be installed. Retry once, then open Diagnostics if the problem continues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安装网络扩展。请重试一次；如果问题仍然存在，请打开“诊断”查看详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension did not answer the proxy selection request in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展未及时响应代理选择请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension did not finish stopping. Wait a moment, then retry; macOS will update the status when shutdown completes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展未能及时完成停止。请稍候再试；关闭完成后，macOS 会自动更新状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension installation is already in progress.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展正在安装，请稍候。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension reports ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展已报告就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension returned an unknown installation result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展返回了未知的安装结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension returned no proxy selection response.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展没有返回代理选择结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension stopped before it became ready. Another active proxy or VPN may be using the required network channel, or the active profile may have failed. Turn off conflicting network extensions, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展在就绪前停止。可能是其他代理或 VPN 占用了所需网络通道，也可能是当前配置启动失败。请关闭冲突的网络扩展，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension stopped before it could report ready. Retry once, then review the active profile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展在报告就绪前停止。请先重试一次，再检查当前配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension was installed and will be available after this Mac restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展已安装，重新启动这台 Mac 后即可使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new network engine and automatic rollback both failed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新网络引擎与自动恢复均失败，请检查诊断信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new network engine could not connect. The previous engine was restored.": {
