            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要检查并重新准备已保存的网络扩展配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secure connection could not start. Review the profile and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全连接无法启动。请检查配置后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file is not a valid AetherRoute portable archive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
