        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to AetherRoute": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 AetherRoute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you connect, traffic and DNS queries may be sent to the proxy and DNS services in your profile. Subscription updates contact your provider; routing rule updates contact public data sources after connection. These services may observe your IP address. Review and trust a provider before importing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接后，流量和 DNS 查询可能发送至配置中的代理和 DNS 服务。订阅更新会联系你的服务商；路由规则会在连接后从公开数据源更新。这些服务可能看到你的 IP 地址，请仅导入你信任的配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can cancel safely while readiness checks are running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "就绪检查期间可以安全取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
