    "Could not connect": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes over each app's connections. Most compatible; recommended for everyday use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按应用接管网络连接，兼容性最好，推荐日常使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Captures all traffic through a virtual network interface and can offer a local proxy for Terminal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过虚拟网卡接管全部流量，可为终端提供本地代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transparent Proxy or TUN?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透明代理还是 TUN？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transparent Proxy · recommended for most people": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透明代理 · 推荐大多数人使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes over each app's network connections. The simplest choice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按应用接管网络连接，最省心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works more easily alongside a company VPN, Tailscale and other network tools.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和公司 VPN、Tailscale 等其他网络工具更容易同时使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bypass rules can use domains and IP ranges.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绕过规则支持域名和 IP 网段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No local proxy port, so exporting a proxy in Terminal does not work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不提供本地代理端口，终端里 export 代理用不了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DNS page overrides do not apply; the system DNS is used.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DNS 页的覆盖设置不生效，使用系统 DNS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TUN · when you need to capture all traffic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN · 需要接管全部流量时用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creates a virtual network interface and captures this Mac's IPv4 and IPv6 traffic at the network layer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建虚拟网卡，在网络层接管这台 Mac 的 IPv4 与 IPv6 流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can offer a local HTTP / SOCKS proxy (127.0.0.1:7890) for Terminal and developer tools.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可开启本地 HTTP / SOCKS 代理（127.0.0.1:7890），终端和开发工具可直接使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DNS behaviour, such as Fake-IP, can be adjusted on the DNS page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在 DNS 页调整解析方式（如 Fake-IP）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bypass rules use IP ranges only, not domains.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绕过规则只支持 IP 网段，不支持域名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With other software that also uses a virtual interface, such as Tailscale, domain names may fail to resolve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 Tailscale 等同样使用虚拟网卡的软件同时开启时，可能出现无法解析域名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to choose": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "怎么选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If unsure, use Transparent Proxy. Switch to TUN when you need a Terminal proxy, want to adjust DNS, or an app does not go through the proxy. You can switch at any time; while connected, AetherRoute reconnects automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不确定就用透明代理。需要终端代理、调整 DNS，或某个程序不走代理时，切换到 TUN。可以随时切换，连接中切换会自动重连。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These options adjust DNS behaviour for the TUN engine without editing your profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些选项用于调整 TUN 引擎的 DNS 行为，无需修改配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes apply the next time TUN connects. Restore profile defaults at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改在下一次 TUN 连接时生效，随时可以恢复配置默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They have no effect with Transparent Proxy, which uses the system DNS.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用透明代理时这些设置不生效，DNS 使用系统解析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Normal: return each domain's real IP address. The most compatible.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "普通：返回域名的真实 IP 地址，兼容性最好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fake-IP: return a placeholder address (198.18.x.x) and route by domain when the connection starts. Faster first connections and more accurate routing; a few apps that rely on real IPs may not work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fake-IP：先返回一个虚拟地址（198.18.x.x），建立连接时再按域名分流。首次连接更快、分流更准；少数依赖真实 IP 的程序可能不兼容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redir-host: return the real IP and remember which domain it belongs to for routing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redir-host：返回真实 IP，并记住它对应的域名用于分流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: IPv6 addresses (AAAA records) may be returned.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启：允许返回 IPv6 地址（AAAA 记录）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: only IPv4 addresses are returned. If your network or node does not support IPv6, turning this off avoids slow or failing connections.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：只返回 IPv4 地址。网络或节点不支持 IPv6 时，关闭可避免连接变慢或失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: DNS lookups themselves follow your routing rules and go through the proxy or directly, which reduces interference with overseas domains.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启：DNS 查询本身也按分流规则走代理或直连，可减少境外域名解析被干扰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: DNS lookups use the core's direct path, which is quicker.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：DNS 查询走核心的直连路径，速度更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosts entries in the profile pin a domain to a fixed IP address, like the system hosts file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置中的 hosts 条目会把指定域名固定解析到指定 IP，类似系统的 hosts 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This follows the profile and is shown here for reference; edit the profile to change it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一项由配置文件决定，这里仅显示状态；如需修改，请编辑配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn more on the AetherRoute website": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在官网了解 AetherRoute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮助：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect to the world, a little more easily.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接世界，轻松一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A native, lightweight network connection experience, tuned for Apple silicon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生、轻快的网络连接体验，专为 Apple 芯片深度优化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute Website": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 官网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New in This Version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本版本更新说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Release History": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "历史版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy Policy": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私政策"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Support & Feedback": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持与反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn More": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "了解更多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aether Native · A little more thought for your Mac and iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aether Native · 为你的 Mac 和 iPhone，多想一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accept the privacy notice to make changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先接受隐私说明，才能修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection is changing state…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接状态切换中，请稍候…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't change while connected. Disconnect to adjust; changes apply on the next connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接中不能修改。断开连接后可调整，下次连接时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saving other changes…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在保存其他更改…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DNS adjustments in TUN mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN 模式下的 DNS 调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Override the active profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "覆盖当前配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes are validated first and apply the next time you connect with TUN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改会先校验，下次以 TUN 连接时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows profile: %@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随配置：%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AAAA responses are allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 AAAA 响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AAAA responses are filtered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "过滤 AAAA 响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By rule count": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按规则数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct rules: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直连规则 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxy rules: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理规则 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reject rules: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拒绝规则 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Global mode does not match rules; all traffic goes through the proxy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全局模式下不按规则匹配，所有流量都走代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct mode does not match rules; all traffic connects directly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直连模式下不按规则匹配，所有流量都直接连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are DNS adjustments in TUN mode?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么是 TUN 模式下的 DNS 调整？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Follow profile” keeps whatever the profile file says.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择“跟随配置”表示沿用配置文件中的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow profile: keep the resolution mode from the profile file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随配置：沿用配置文件中的解析模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If unsure, keep “Follow profile”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不确定就保持“跟随配置”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow profile: keep the setting from the profile file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随配置：沿用配置文件中的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a backup provider or a separate work setup and switch between them from the menu bar. Add one with the buttons above, or enter nodes by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留一个备用服务商或单独的工作配置，随时在菜单栏中切换。可用上方按钮添加，也可以手动录入节点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld nodes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld node"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld nodes"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个节点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld endpoints": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld endpoint"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld endpoints"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个代理节点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld upstreams": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld upstream"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld upstreams"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个上游"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld resolvers": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld resolver"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld resolvers"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个解析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld domain rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld domain rule"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld domain rules"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 条域名规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Showing %lld of %lld items": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Showing %1$lld of %#@total@"
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "total": {
              "argNum": 2,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg item"
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%arg items"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示 %1$lld 项，共 %2$lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counted on this Mac only; nothing is reported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只统计本机可见的连接，不上报"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each live connection shows its destination, matched rule, outlet and traffic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条连接显示目标、命中的规则、出口和流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect to see each connection's destination, matched rule, outlet and traffic.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接后，这里会列出每条连接的目标、命中的规则、出口和流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split by rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按规则分流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything through the proxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部流量经代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything connects directly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部流量直接连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forwards each app's connections": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按应用连接转发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual interface takes all traffic": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "虚拟网卡接管全部流量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peak %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "峰值 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 s ago": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 秒前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在"
          }
        }
      }
    }
